 "router": {
  "model": "CHR",
  "osVersion": "7.24.3"
 },
 "note": "Captured from the CHR test router. A server created FOR the capture (disabled, as RouterOS creates one) beside any the CHR ships. `auth` and `cipher` are comma lists. New in the 7.x server list: each server is its own row with a name. MAC addresses replaced with locally administered ones; the peer address mapped into TEST-NET-2. Read through /interface/ovpn-server/server/print.",
 "exchanges": [
  {
